# Nightly computer health review (local-health-check): crashes, panics,
# launchd exits, SMART, memory/load, log-fault spikes, new persistence,
# network sanity. Findings print an SD_REPORT_ATTENTION line, so the run's
# report reaches Reports and Today; the job exits 0 with findings.
JOB_SCHEDULE="15 4 * * *"
JOB_COMMAND="sh \"$ROOT/../local-health-check/health-check.sh\" run"
